# Whitelist: everything is excluded unless listed below. This keeps the build
# context tiny (no target/, no .git/, no fuzz corpora) and deliberately omits
# rust-toolchain.toml so the builder image's preinstalled stable toolchain is
# used instead of rustup re-downloading the channel (+ rustfmt/clippy
# components) on every image build.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates
!ferrixd.example.toml
